',·marginBottom:·14·}}␍⏎····>␍⏎······<span·style={{·color:·tokens.colorNeutralForeground3,·fontSize:·12·}}>␍⏎········Preview·state:␍⏎······</span>␍⏎······{(['data',·'loading',·'empty',·'error']·as·const).map((option)·=>·(␍⏎········<Button␍⏎··········key={option}␍⏎··········size=\"small\"␍⏎··········appearance={state·===·option·?·'primary'·:·'subtle'}␍⏎··········onClick={()·=>·onChange(option)}␍⏎········>␍⏎··········{option}␍⏎········</Button>␍⏎······))}␍⏎····</div>␍⏎··)`",{"range":"348","text":"349"},"Replace `·Button,·Card,·CardHeader,·MessageBar,·Skeleton,·Table,·TableBody,·TableCell,·TableHeader,·TableHeaderCell,·TableRow,·Title1,·Title2,·Title3,·Body1,·Caption1,·tokens·` with `␍⏎··Button,␍⏎··Card,␍⏎··CardHeader,␍⏎··MessageBar,␍⏎··Skeleton,␍⏎··Table,␍⏎··TableBody,␍⏎··TableCell,␍⏎··TableHeader,␍⏎··TableHeaderCell,␍⏎··TableRow,␍⏎··Title1,␍⏎··Title2,␍⏎··Title3,␍⏎··Body1,␍⏎··Caption1,␍⏎··tokens,␍⏎`",{"range":"350","text":"351"},"Replace `·AddRegular,·ArrowRightRegular,·CalendarRegular,·CheckmarkCircleRegular,·ErrorCircleRegular,·LocationRegular,·PeopleTeamRegular·` with `␍⏎··AddRegular,␍⏎··ArrowRightRegular,␍⏎··CalendarRegular,␍⏎··CheckmarkCircleRegular,␍⏎··ErrorCircleRegular,␍⏎··LocationRegular,␍⏎··PeopleTeamRegular,␍⏎`",{"range":"352","text":"353"},"Replace `·BookingRecord,·DataState,·EventRecord,·VenueRecord·` with `␍⏎··BookingRecord,␍⏎··DataState,␍⏎··EventRecord,␍⏎··VenueRecord,␍⏎`",{"range":"354","text":"355"},"@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars","'BookingRecord' is defined but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar",["356"],"'EventRecord' is defined but never used.",["357"],"'VenueRecord' is defined but never used.",["358"],"Replace `·title,·eyebrow,·description,·action,·href·}:·{·title:·string;·eyebrow:·string;·description:·string;·action:·string;·href:·string·` with `␍⏎··title,␍⏎··eyebrow,␍⏎··description,␍⏎··action,␍⏎··href,␍⏎}:·{␍⏎··title:·string;␍⏎··eyebrow:·string;␍⏎··description:·string;␍⏎··action:·string;␍⏎··href:·string;␍⏎`",{"range":"359","text":"360"},"R